      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I need some help with a sensitive email. I'm a department head at a software company and we're hitting a lot of scope creep on our current project. It's starting to mess with our capacity and the original timeline. Can you help me draft an email to my boss asking for either more headcount or an extension on the deadline? I want to sound professional but firm about the fact that we can't keep absorbing new requirements without more resources.",
